Osijek Parking Zone - published zone data

Files: osijek_parking_segments_v3.geojson, osijek_parking_lots.geojson, osijek_parking_data.json

Street and car-park geometry is derived from OpenStreetMap data,
(c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/  -  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

These files are a derivative database and are made available under the same ODbL 1.0 terms.
Zone assignments, prices and hours are taken from public information by GPP d.o.o. Osijek
(https://www.gpp-osijek.com/); they are not official GPP data and may be out of date.
